{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220670","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220670","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1322067001:0":{"text":"ダイモン、ダイモン……まだ寝ているの？","source_cn":"戴蒙，戴蒙……你睡了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF922666A403DFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322067002:0":{"text":"ダイモン……あなた、ずっと玩具の木馬を欲しがってたでしょ？見て、ママとパパが作ったのよ。","source_cn":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D71187FF02D30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322067003:0":{"text":"すごくいい出来とは言えないけれど……気に入ってくれると嬉しいわ。","source_cn":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41574E28C5A40CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322067004:1":{"text":"ダイモン？","source_cn":"戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F535C6B7FB97988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322067005:1":{"text":"まだ怒っているのか、それとも悲しんでいるのか、ダイモンは黙り込んだままだ。","source_cn":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE37ACAD12321C84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322067006:1":{"text":"ダイモン……お母さんを無視しないで、お願いよ、ダイモン。","source_cn":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DF23D8F640E8180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322067007:1":{"text":"きっとキキがいなくて悲しいのだよ……もう返してやったらどうだね？","source_cn":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5795AFF863B618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322067008:1":{"text":"でも、キキを返したら、また勝手に外に出るかも……やっぱりダメよ、キキはまだ返せないわ。","source_cn":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AE7AA16B080E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322067009:1":{"text":"はぁ……シェミーラ、あまり厳しくしすぎるのも……","source_cn":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF4824C23D88C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322067010:1":{"text":"他の方法を考えましょう。どうすればダイモンを喜ばせてあげられるかしら……","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1322067010":{"text":"他の方法を考えましょう。どうすればダイモンを喜ばせてあげられるかしら……","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322067011:1":{"text":"キキを没収されて、一緒に遊べる相手もいなくて寂しいんですよ！","source_cn":"你们没收了奇奇，他一个人多孤单，只有玩伴才能让他开心起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99B03CA0A391F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322067012:1":{"text":"うーん……ダイモン君が外に出られないのなら、この場所に「遊び相手」を作ってあげるのはどうでしょうか？","source_cn":"唔……要是戴蒙不方便出门的话，那我们就在这里“制造玩伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8F8E412CFD5901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322067013:1":{"text":"冬の祭典で出会った、スヴァルフさんを覚えていますか？魔法で暴れる雪だるまを作ったあのメイジさんですよ。","source_cn":"你们还记不记得冬日祭典上那个叫维茨瓦夫的魔法师，还有他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x659EEABC033CB0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322067014:1":{"text":"私たちも雪だるまを作って、魔法で動かしてあげれば、ダイモン君の遊び相手になるのでは？","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1322067014":{"text":"私たちも雪だるまを作って、魔法で動かしてあげれば、ダイモン君の遊び相手になるのでは？","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322067015:3":{"text":"雪だるまを作るのね？それなら、ダイモンが外に出るよりは安全そうね。","source_cn":"堆雪人？嗯……这样比让戴蒙跑出门安全多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC5224C1AF82BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1322067016:1":{"text":"よーし、雪だるまをたくさん作りましょう！","source_cn":"那我们就堆好多个雪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1789F721173E238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"いいアイデアだ！","source_cn":"好提议！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2A6EAEF5A467EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"いいアイデアだ！","female":"いいアイデアね！","variant_male_record_index":"70940","variant_female_record_index":"70941","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"まあ、一応遊び相手にはなるか。","source_cn":"行吧……雪人也算是玩伴","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB10B6D7533039ED7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"まあ、一応遊び相手にはなるか。","female":"まあ、一応遊び相手にはなるわね。","variant_male_record_index":"70942","variant_female_record_index":"70943","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"この子に必要なのは友だちだ。","source_cn":